{"Categories":[8],"HiddenTopics":[26],"Topics":[9],"Id":63,"TextResource":{"Name":"la-pausa","Translations":[{"Text":"La Pausa","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"La Pausa","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":0}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>El descanso necesario antes de un viaje, con una gastronomía de alta calidad y con preparaciones a la vista en el mismo momento en que realice su pedido, disfrutando de la cocina regional y otras recetas tradicionales en un espacio acogedor.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>Get the rest you need before traveling, with high-quality gastronomy and an open kitchen that allows you to view food preparation the minute you place an order, and enjoy regional cuisine and other traditional recipes in a cozy atmosphere.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916780","Updated":"1488916780","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/063_la-pausa.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/restaurants\/la-pausa","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/restaurantes\/la-pausa","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/063_la-pausa.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/63\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/063_la-pausa.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/63\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[]},"HasAdditionalInfo":false}